  "body": "[You-Get](https://you-get.org/) **0.4.1743** is now [released on PyPI](http://pypi.python.org/pypi/you-get/0.4.1743).\r\n\r\nPlease upgrade to the latest version:\r\n\r\n``` console\r\n$ pip install --upgrade you-get\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* [YouTube] Fix extraction\r\n* Fix: Restore functionality of -o parameter for Miaopai downloads by @doskey in https://github.com/soimort/you-get/pull/3030\r\n* remove imported but unsed module by @ljhcage in https://github.com/soimort/you-get/pull/3032\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @doskey made their first contribution in https://github.com/soimort/you-get/pull/3030\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/soimort/you-get/compare/v0.4.1730...v0.4.1743",
